[h1]Spy Repeat[/h1]
[b]Preview 0.2.3 · Native UI interaction update · Single-player only[/b]

Repeat assigned spy missions and counterspy duties. Pause when intervention is needed.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
Send a new spy to a city first; the destination list only previews missions. Guidance explains where to enable repeat after arrival. Choose a mission, check Repeat in its native briefing, then accept. Cancelling discards the draft. For counterspy duties, check Repeat counterspy before choosing a district. Manage status, stop or resume directly in the spy overview. The unit action with the native Auto Explore icon enables, disables or resumes repeat with one click; gold means enabled and its tooltip shows the mission and status. Turning repeat off preserves the current mission. Promotions, travel, escape and invalid targets pause repeat until you intervene.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
The target setup is Gathering Storm with Harmony in Diversity. Partial real-game checks were performed in one user HD collection; full feature and compatibility validation remains pending. Multiplayer and hotseat are unsupported. Avoid assigning the same objects to another automation mod.
Uses Lua/XML only; no DLL changes. Extends three native Lua contexts (mission briefing, chooser and overview). Other mods replacing those contexts may override these additions or be overridden.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Include game/DLC/HD versions, enabled mods, reproduction steps and relevant Lua.log or Modding.log errors.

